# E-RAKSHAK — local configuration
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (same directory) and fill in your key. `.env` is
# gitignored; this example file is not, so never put a real key in here.

# ── Investigation Copilot (optional) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Enables the AI case summary and Q&A panel. Everything else in the platform —
# ingestion, entity resolution, the seven rules, scoring, the graphs, the
# forensic report and the STR — runs without it. Leave this unset and the
# copilot panel simply shows a "not connected" state.
#
# Get a free key: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional. Defaults to gemini-2.5-flash, falling back to gemini-2.0-flash and
# then gemini-flash-latest if the key cannot reach the first choice.
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash
